   "subject": "Re: lavaan package deployment error: unable to load shared object ''/opt/R/3.4.0/lib/R/library/quadprog/libs/quadprog.so'",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The problem is that quadprog, while it successfully installed, was improperly compiled against a bad R binary and then cached.<div>When lavaan was installed, it tried to actually load the shared library from quadprog, which failed due linking against a library from that bad R binary.</div><div>I have flushed quadprog from the cache for R 3.4.0, and that should cause it to be rebuilt against the proper R binary.</div><div><br></div><div>Let me know how it goes.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
